# UI-WINDOW-1 fix round R1 (F6, F7) at 1024 x 768, the right chrome at x 779..1023:
# F7: a left press on the chrome, a motion with the button held and a release start no pan (the
#     `camera.pans` fact counts pan() calls); the same drag on the map does pan (control).
# F6: a UI press whose release is lost (`ldown_px`) is dropped on focus loss and on the next
#     press, so the release of a later map click reaches the selection (`selection.clicks`).
# Launch: --play data/maps/lan5.txt --construction-menu on --layout data/ui
resize 1024 768
wait frames 5
look 1140 516
note fact camera.pans
ldrag_px 900 500 300 300
wait frames 3
expect fact camera.pans same
expect fact ui.press == 0
ldrag_px 400 400 300 300
wait frames 3
expect fact camera.pans > 0
ldown_px 900 500
wait frames 2
expect fact ui.press == 1
focus-lost
wait frames 2
expect fact ui.press == 0
ldown_px 900 500
wait frames 2
expect fact ui.press == 1
note fact selection.clicks
click_px 300 300
wait frames 3
expect fact ui.press == 0
expect fact selection.clicks == 1
quit
